	(text "How to use: blue entries are hyperlinks. In KiCad hover/click the link; in the exported PDF just click it.\nEach symbol's own Datasheet field holds the same link, so selecting a part and pressing D opens its datasheet.\nLCSC links open the LCSC part page (stock, price, footprint); LCSC datasheet links open LCSC's PDF viewer.\nPinouts of U1, U2, U3, X1, D1, D2, Q1–Q4, BZ1 were checked against these datasheets (last full re-check 2026-10-13). Every symbol also carries MPN + Manufacturer fields."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
